# ── THE PUBLIC-REPO LAW (2026-08-13) ───────────────────────────────────────────
# This repo is PUBLIC. It has to be: GitHub Pages serves the site from it, and a
# free account cannot serve Pages from a private repo. So everything committed
# here is world-readable, on every branch, forever — not just on master.
#
# On 2026-08-12 two working branches (claude/dark-sun-content-videos-w507de and
# claude/solo-dnd-content-ax050t) were pushed here carrying agent working files,
# including a 25 KB editorial ledger of Frank's own 78-entry campaign bestiary,
# pulled from his Drive and marked "nothing below is publish-ready." It was
# anonymously readable. Both branches were backed up and deleted 2026-08-13.
#
# Nothing but the WEBSITE belongs in this repo. Working notes, agent config,
# build tooling and unreleased content live in Cerberus, which stays local.
